Description: Preserve modern ServeMux semantics in GOPATH builds
 Debian's Go build system uses GOPATH mode, so the go directive from go.mod is
 not available when the linker selects GODEBUG defaults. PixLog's capture API
 uses method-aware patterns introduced in Go 1.22. Embed the modern ServeMux
 default in both command binaries.
Author: Xuan Zhao <zhaoxuan0914@gmail.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-07-31

--- a/cmd/git-pixlog/main.go
+++ b/cmd/git-pixlog/main.go
@@ -1 +1,2 @@
+//go:debug httpmuxgo121=0
 package main

--- a/cmd/pixlog/main.go
+++ b/cmd/pixlog/main.go
@@ -1 +1,2 @@
+//go:debug httpmuxgo121=0
 package main
